Z||000010||Brandon86SE||11-17-2001||04:29 PM||||Adrift.........  sounds like a chopshop operation to me.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  I'd be more likely to call the cops on 'em than go buy something from 'em.  My best friend just recently had his car stolen.  He was lucky to get it back with only a shot turbo, missing $2000 stereo, and a dent in the bumper.  Since my friend had his car stolen I wouldn't even consider getting anything that might be "hot".  Just think about the guy who used to have that stuff, and actually worked hard and paid for them.  I saw what he went through, and hope I'm lucky enough that I never have to go through it, and certainly won't support it.<P>No flame intended, just a warning.<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
