Z||000012||Hybrid2M6||11-23-2001||07:00 AM||||I have American Racing Carrera's (AR49's) on mine.  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/loweredfront.jpg"> <BR>I put 16" wheels on the front with a tire size of 225/50VR16, Falken Ziex 502's<BR>On the rear I have a 17" wheel with 225/45ZR17, those however are my baby's, newly designed Falken Azenis Racing tires.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/azenis.gif"> <BR>Really low profile, great tread pattern for damp surfaces, and really hug the road when you heat em' up. Ever since my first set of Falken's, I SWEAR BY THEM!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/customgfx.jpg"> <BR>1986 SE IronDuke<BR>Adjustable Touring Wing<BR>American Racing Carrera's<BR> -225/50VR16 Falken Ziex 502<BR> -225/45ZR17 Falken Azenis<BR>Cleared and Painted(red) Tail lights||||reg||14
